  user_1,[00:00] Hello, is this Neha? I... uh... I wanted to talk about my travel policy.
  user_2,[00:05] Hi Dhruv, yes speaking. This is Neha from Shield Life Services. How can I help you today?
  user_1,[00:12] Yeah, so I just booked a trip to Europe next month and I want to make sure the policy is active. --
  user_2,[00:18] Let me pull up your details... [typing] Give me a sec.
  user_2,[00:25] Okay, I see your Travel Policy SH-TRV-2026 is currently pending activation. Did you receive the welcome email?
  user_1,[00:33] Uh, I think I got something but... I couldn't find the attachment. Can you resend?
  user_2,[00:40] Sure, I'll resend it now. Also, to activate, we just need your confirmation of travel dates.
  user_1,[00:48] Got it, the dates are 15th Oct to 30th Oct. Please go ahead and activate.
  user_2,[00:55] Done! Your policy status is now Active. You'll get a confirmation email shortly.